"Basic" = "Dasar";
"Basic hides the advanced settings and runs them at their defaults until you switch back." = "Dasar menyembunyikan pengaturan lanjutan dan menjalankannya dengan nilai default sampai Anda beralih kembali.";
"Basic keeps Settings short. The advanced settings run at their defaults and their rows are hidden.\n\nAdvanced shows all of them: the renderer, scaling filters, gamma, Steady frame rate, CPU cores, when cooling down starts, the emulated clock, overlay details, stick feel, audio channels, diagnostics, and a game's own CPU cores, filters and Steady frame rate. The performance profile, motion aiming, library grouping and settings backups are in both.\n\nWhen you switch to Basic, MuffinEMU sets your advanced settings, and each game's, aside and uses the defaults. Switching back to Advanced puts them all back as they were.\n\nReset settings to defaults (under About) also puts this back to Basic and forgets the saved values." = "Dasar menjaga Pengaturan tetap ringkas. Pengaturan lanjutan berjalan dengan nilai default dan barisnya disembunyikan.\n\nLanjutan menampilkan semuanya: renderer, filter penskalaan, gamma, Frame rate stabil, inti CPU, kapan pendinginan dimulai, jam emulasi, detail overlay, nuansa stik, kanal audio, diagnostik, serta inti CPU, filter, dan Frame rate stabil milik game. Profil performa, bidikan gerak, pengelompokan pustaka, dan cadangan pengaturan ada di keduanya.\n\nSaat Anda beralih ke Dasar, MuffinEMU menyisihkan pengaturan lanjutan Anda, dan milik tiap game, lalu memakai nilai default. Beralih kembali ke Lanjutan mengembalikan semuanya seperti semula.\n\nReset pengaturan ke default (di Tentang) juga mengembalikan ini ke Dasar dan melupakan nilai yang disimpan.";
