"Enable" = "Aktifkan";
"Encrypted Wii U games need a keys.txt dumped from your own Wii U. MuffinEMU doesn't include one. Homebrew doesn't need it." = "Game Wii U terenkripsi memerlukan keys.txt yang di-dump dari Wii U Anda sendiri. MuffinEMU tidak menyertakannya. Homebrew tidak memerlukannya.";
"Encrypted games (.wux, .wud, .iso) need AES keys dumped from your own Wii U, in a text file called keys.txt with one key per line. MuffinEMU doesn't include keys.\n\nYou can also open MuffinEMU in the Files app and drop keys.txt into the \"keys\" folder.\n\nNew keys are used the next time you start a game. If you've already started a game since opening MuffinEMU, quit and reopen MuffinEMU first." = "Game terenkripsi (.wux, .wud, .iso) memerlukan kunci AES yang di-dump dari Wii U Anda sendiri, dalam file teks bernama keys.txt dengan satu kunci per baris. MuffinEMU tidak menyertakan kunci.\n\nAnda juga dapat membuka MuffinEMU di app File dan menaruh keys.txt di folder \"keys\".\n\nKunci baru dipakai saat Anda memulai game berikutnya. Jika Anda sudah memulai game sejak membuka MuffinEMU, keluar dan buka kembali MuffinEMU terlebih dahulu.";
"Encrypted games need Wii U keys, so they come first. Then how your games look and where cover art comes from." = "Game terenkripsi memerlukan kunci Wii U, jadi itu yang pertama. Lalu tampilan game Anda dan asal gambar sampul.";
"Encrypted games won't run until you import a keys.txt again. Homebrew is unaffected." = "Game terenkripsi tidak akan berjalan sampai Anda mengimpor keys.txt lagi. Homebrew tidak terpengaruh.";
