"Every control style now uses your calibration. Run it again any time, or reset it from the stick settings." = "Setiap gaya kontrol kini memakai kalibrasi Anda. Jalankan lagi kapan saja, atau reset dari pengaturan stik.";
"Every game" = "Setiap game";
"Every group (shoulders, sticks, d-pad, A/B/X/Y, Start, Select, HOME) can be dragged and pinch-resized. Tap the move icon in the top bar during a game.\n\nFit floats the controls over the screen. Native sizes the picture to fit around the controls: small on a phone, life-size on an iPad.\n\nThis pad is experimental." = "Setiap grup (bahu, stik, d-pad, A/B/X/Y, Start, Select, HOME) dapat diseret dan diubah ukurannya dengan cubitan. Ketuk ikon pindah di bilah atas saat bermain.\n\nPas mengambangkan kontrol di atas layar. Native menyesuaikan ukuran gambar di sekitar kontrol: kecil di ponsel, seukuran aslinya di iPad.\n\nPad ini eksperimental.";
"Every group goes back to the preset's own position and size, in every game. The preset, colours and picture mode you picked stay as they are." = "Setiap grup kembali ke posisi dan ukuran bawaan preset, di setiap game. Preset, warna, dan mode gambar yang Anda pilih tetap seperti semula.";
"Every group goes back to the preset's own positions and sizes. The preset, colours and picture mode you picked are untouched." = "Setiap grup kembali ke posisi dan ukuran bawaan preset. Preset, warna, dan mode gambar yang Anda pilih tidak berubah.";
"Every menu here starts with \"Same as Settings\", which follows the matching setting in Settings, even if you change it later. Picking anything else sets it for this game only and puts a dot beside it.\n\nScreen layout and Hide on-screen controls when a controller is connected are put in place when the game starts, and your own choices come back when it stops. A layout change you make during the game is not kept.\n\nPerformance overlay On uses the corner chosen in Settings, or the top left if Settings has it off.\n\nChanges apply the next time you start the game." = "Setiap menu di sini dimulai dengan \"Sama seperti Pengaturan\", yang mengikuti pengaturan yang sesuai di Pengaturan, bahkan jika Anda mengubahnya nanti. Memilih yang lain hanya mengaturnya untuk game ini dan menaruh titik di sampingnya.\n\nTata letak layar dan Sembunyikan kontrol di layar saat kontroler terhubung diterapkan saat game dimulai, dan pilihan Anda sendiri kembali saat game berhenti. Perubahan tata letak yang Anda buat selama game tidak disimpan.\n\nOverlay performa Aktif memakai sudut yang dipilih di Pengaturan, atau kiri atas jika di Pengaturan mati.\n\nPerubahan berlaku saat Anda memulai game berikutnya.";
"Every setting you've changed, and games with settings of their own." = "Setiap pengaturan yang Anda ubah, dan game dengan pengaturan sendiri.";
"Every setting you've changed, wherever it is. Tap one to go to it." = "Setiap pengaturan yang Anda ubah, di mana pun letaknya. Ketuk satu untuk membukanya.";
"Everything else" = "Lainnya";
"Everything is at its default." = "Semuanya di nilai default.";
"Everything is shown, including the settings most people never need." = "Semuanya ditampilkan, termasuk pengaturan yang tidak dibutuhkan kebanyakan orang.";
"Everything the Menu needs to start is present." = "Semua yang dibutuhkan Menu untuk dimulai sudah ada.";
"Exact title ID" = "ID judul yang tepat";
"Existing %@ saved as %@." = "%@ yang ada disimpan sebagai %@.";
"Expanded" = "Dibentangkan";
"Experimental" = "Eksperimental";
"Experimental. Files must be dumped from your own Wii U. Nothing is included." = "Eksperimental. File harus di-dump dari Wii U Anda sendiri. Tidak ada yang disertakan.";
"Experimental. Replaces the normal pad while on." = "Eksperimental. Menggantikan pad biasa selama aktif.";
"Experimental. Sends a Wii U screen to a connected second display." = "Eksperimental. Mengirim layar Wii U ke layar kedua yang terhubung.";
"Experimental. The Wii U Menu and its support files must come from your own Wii U, dumped with Dumpling. MuffinEMU includes none of them.\n\nImport Wii U Menu: pick the package folder (the one containing mlc01 and cafeLibs), an mlc01 folder, a sys folder, a cafeLibs folder, or the Menu's own title folder. Files are merged one by one into MuffinEMU's storage; anything replaced is saved first, and your saves are never touched.\n\nImport console files: pick otp.bin and seeprom.bin. Only online features need them; the Menu may start without.\n\nOnce the Menu is installed it appears at the top of the library. Games in your library show up in it. You can show it as a card in the game grid instead, or hide it from the library; hiding doesn't uninstall it.\n\nUninstall Wii U Menu deletes only the Menu itself. Shared data, system apps, cafeLibs, otp.bin and seeprom.bin stay, since games can use them. Your saves and your games are never touched." = "Eksperimental. Menu Wii U dan file pendukungnya harus berasal dari Wii U Anda sendiri, di-dump dengan Dumpling. MuffinEMU tidak menyertakannya.\n\nImpor Menu Wii U: pilih folder paket (yang berisi mlc01 dan cafeLibs), folder mlc01, folder sys, folder cafeLibs, atau folder judul Menu itu sendiri. File digabungkan satu per satu ke penyimpanan MuffinEMU; apa pun yang diganti disimpan dulu, dan simpanan Anda tidak pernah disentuh.\n\nImpor file konsol: pilih otp.bin dan seeprom.bin. Hanya fitur online yang memerlukannya; Menu mungkin dapat dimulai tanpanya.\n\nSetelah Menu terpasang, Menu muncul di bagian atas pustaka. Game di pustaka Anda muncul di dalamnya. Anda dapat menampilkannya sebagai kartu di kisi game, atau menyembunyikannya dari pustaka; menyembunyikan tidak mencopot pemasangan.\n\nCopot Menu Wii U hanya menghapus Menu itu sendiri. Data bersama, app sistem, cafeLibs, otp.bin, dan seeprom.bin tetap ada, karena game dapat memakainya. Simpanan dan game Anda tidak pernah disentuh.";
"Experimental. Turn it on before connecting a second screen." = "Eksperimental. Aktifkan sebelum menghubungkan layar kedua.";
"Experimental. Turn it on, then connect a second screen." = "Eksperimental. Aktifkan, lalu hubungkan layar kedua.";
"Experimental: Vulkan runs through MoltenVK on top of Metal. Some games may draw wrongly or stop, and if Vulkan fails the next launch switches back to Metal." = "Eksperimental: Vulkan berjalan melalui MoltenVK di atas Metal. Beberapa game mungkin tergambar salah atau berhenti, dan jika Vulkan gagal, peluncuran berikutnya kembali ke Metal.";
"Export all settings" = "Ekspor semua pengaturan";
"Export all settings writes one .json file to Files: every setting, and the settings you've set for individual games. It never includes your library, favourites, Wii U keys, accounts, theme or premium unlock.\n\nImport settings reads such a file, checks it, and asks before it replaces anything. Importing replaces all your settings and every game's own options with what the file holds, and anything the file doesn't mention goes back to its default. Some changes apply the next time you start a game." = "Ekspor semua pengaturan menulis satu file .json ke File: setiap pengaturan, dan pengaturan yang Anda atur untuk game tertentu. File ini tidak pernah menyertakan pustaka, favorit, kunci Wii U, akun, tema, atau buka kunci premium Anda.\n\nImpor pengaturan membaca file seperti itu, memeriksanya, dan bertanya sebelum mengganti apa pun. Mengimpor mengganti semua pengaturan dan opsi tiap game dengan isi file, dan apa pun yang tidak disebut file kembali ke default. Beberapa perubahan berlaku saat Anda memulai game berikutnya.";
"Export cancelled." = "Ekspor dibatalkan.";
"Export colours (.muffinclr)" = "Ekspor warna (.muffinclr)";
"Export everything" = "Ekspor semuanya";
"Export everything writes one file to Files, in MuffinEMU > Migration. It holds your saves, installed updates and DLC, accounts, keys.txt, otp.bin and seeprom.bin, compiled shader caches, graphic packs, save states, settings, favourites and appearance.\n\nGames (the Roms folder, and base games installed into the Wii U storage) are left out unless you turn on Include games. Without them the export is much smaller, and you can copy your games into the new app in Files. Screen recordings, save backups, logs and other caches are never included. The premium unlock isn't carried over; enter it again in the new app.\n\nThe export runs only while MuffinEMU is open on screen, and keeps the screen awake. You can stop it at any time. Before it starts, MuffinEMU checks that there's enough free space, and the file is kept out of device backups.\n\nWhen it's done, share the file to the new MuffinEMU's Files folder or to another device, install the new MuffinEMU, and choose Import from the old MuffinEMU there. Delete the export afterwards to get the space back." = "Ekspor semuanya menulis satu file ke File, di MuffinEMU > Migration. Isinya simpanan, pembaruan dan DLC terpasang, akun, keys.txt, otp.bin dan seeprom.bin, cache shader terkompilasi, paket grafis, status simpan, pengaturan, favorit, dan tampilan.\n\nGame (folder Roms, dan game dasar yang dipasang di penyimpanan Wii U) tidak disertakan kecuali Anda mengaktifkan Sertakan game. Tanpanya ekspor jauh lebih kecil, dan Anda dapat menyalin game ke app baru di File. Rekaman layar, cadangan simpanan, log, dan cache lain tidak pernah disertakan. Buka kunci premium tidak ikut dipindahkan; masukkan lagi di app baru.\n\nEkspor hanya berjalan saat MuffinEMU terbuka di layar, dan menjaga layar tetap menyala. Anda dapat menghentikannya kapan saja. Sebelum dimulai, MuffinEMU memeriksa apakah ruang kosongnya cukup, dan file dikecualikan dari cadangan perangkat.\n\nSetelah selesai, bagikan file ke folder File MuffinEMU yang baru atau ke perangkat lain, pasang MuffinEMU yang baru, dan pilih Impor dari MuffinEMU lama di sana. Hapus ekspor setelahnya untuk mengembalikan ruangnya.";
"Export everything, or import from the old MuffinEMU." = "Ekspor semuanya, atau impor dari MuffinEMU lama.";
