"Learned shaders" = "Shader terpelajari";
"Learned shaders are what a game has revealed by drawing with them. Importing adds them to this game's own file: anything the game already has stays as it is, and the file is never replaced.\n\nThe file has to be this game's: MuffinEMU checks the version stamp inside it, not the name. Desktop Cemu's files work: learned shaders are named like 000500001010ec00_shaders.bin and are converted the first time the game starts. MuffinEMU's are named ..._mtlshaders.bin. Desktop caches from before Cemu 1.16 use another format and can't be converted.\n\nPipeline caches are named ..._vkpipeline.bin (desktop Cemu, Vulkan) or ..._mtlpipeline.bin (MuffinEMU, Metal). A Vulkan one only helps the Vulkan renderer and a Metal one only the Metal renderer; it's stored either way and used when you switch. Each also needs the game's learned shaders. Import with the game closed. The sizes in Settings update the next time you open it." = "Shader terpelajari adalah yang terungkap saat game menggambar dengannya. Mengimpor menambahkannya ke file milik game ini: apa pun yang sudah dimiliki game tetap seperti semula, dan file tidak pernah diganti.\n\nFile harus milik game ini: MuffinEMU memeriksa cap versi di dalamnya, bukan namanya. File Cemu desktop berfungsi: shader terpelajari dinamai seperti 000500001010ec00_shaders.bin dan dikonversi saat game pertama kali dimulai. Milik MuffinEMU dinamai ..._mtlshaders.bin. Cache desktop sebelum Cemu 1.16 memakai format lain dan tidak dapat dikonversi.\n\nCache pipeline dinamai ..._vkpipeline.bin (Cemu desktop, Vulkan) atau ..._mtlpipeline.bin (MuffinEMU, Metal). Yang Vulkan hanya membantu renderer Vulkan dan yang Metal hanya renderer Metal; keduanya disimpan dan dipakai saat Anda beralih. Masing-masing juga memerlukan shader terpelajari game. Impor dengan game tertutup. Ukuran di Pengaturan diperbarui saat Anda membukanya lagi.";
