"Position picks a corner of the TV screen; Off hides every pop-up, and the other rows stay dimmed until a corner is chosen.\n\nController profiles: your account name and each controller's saved profile, for a few seconds after a game starts. Low controller battery: a paired controller is running down. Shader compiling: shown while the engine builds new shaders. Friends: friend activity from your account." = "Posisi memilih sudut layar TV; Mati menyembunyikan semua pop-up, dan baris lain tetap redup sampai sudut dipilih.\n\nProfil kontroler: nama akun Anda dan profil tersimpan tiap kontroler, selama beberapa detik setelah game dimulai. Baterai kontroler lemah: kontroler yang dipasangkan hampir habis. Kompilasi shader: ditampilkan saat engine membangun shader baru. Teman: aktivitas teman dari akun Anda.";
