"Save states are lost when the game or the app closes, including when iOS closes the app to free memory. For anything you want to keep, use the game's own save.\n\nSwipe a slot left, or press and hold it, to delete.\n\nA save state loads back only while the game keeps running from the launch it was saved in. After you quit or relaunch the game or the app, older saves stay in their slots but can't be loaded yet. Delete them, or save over them.\n\nAfter loading, some textures may briefly flash their old contents." = "Status simpan hilang saat game atau app ditutup, termasuk saat iOS menutup app untuk membebaskan memori. Untuk apa pun yang ingin Anda simpan, gunakan simpanan game itu sendiri.\n\nGeser slot ke kiri, atau tekan dan tahan, untuk menghapus.\n\nStatus simpan hanya dimuat selama game terus berjalan dari peluncuran tempat status itu disimpan. Setelah Anda keluar atau meluncurkan ulang game atau app, simpanan lama tetap di slotnya tetapi belum dapat dimuat. Hapus, atau simpan di atasnya.\n\nSetelah memuat, beberapa tekstur mungkin sebentar berkedip dengan isi lamanya.";
"Save states can't be loaded after you quit. Use the game's own save." = "Status simpan tidak dapat dimuat setelah Anda keluar. Gunakan simpanan game itu sendiri.";
