"TV and GamePad audio are separate tracks with their own on/off, volume and channel layout.\n\nChannels: Mono mixes everything to one channel, Stereo splits left and right (default), Surround asks the game for more channels; most games only use stereo. Turning TV or GamePad audio on or off, and changing channels, applies the next time you start a game.\n\nGamePad audio plays whatever the game sends to the GamePad speaker. Many games send nothing different from the TV mix.\n\nUse microphone feeds your device's real microphone to games that ask for the GamePad mic, while the game has the mic open. iOS asks for permission the first time you turn it on; if you say no, it switches back off. While it's on, the in-game Blow button is hidden. When it's off, games still see a GamePad mic, but it only hears the Blow button (a simulated puff of air) and iOS never asks for permission. Microphone volume (50 is normal, 100 is twice as loud) applies the next time a game opens the mic." = "Audio TV dan GamePad adalah trek terpisah dengan sakelar aktif/mati, volume, dan tata letak kanal sendiri.\n\nKanal: Mono memadukan semuanya ke satu kanal, Stereo memisahkan kiri dan kanan (default), Surround meminta game memberi lebih banyak kanal; kebanyakan game hanya memakai stereo. Menyalakan atau mematikan audio TV atau GamePad, dan mengubah kanal, berlaku saat Anda memulai game berikutnya.\n\nAudio GamePad memutar apa pun yang dikirim game ke speaker GamePad. Banyak game tidak mengirim apa pun yang berbeda dari campuran TV.\n\nGunakan mikrofon mengalirkan mikrofon asli perangkat Anda ke game yang meminta mikrofon GamePad, selama game membuka mikrofon. iOS meminta izin saat pertama kali Anda menyalakannya; jika Anda menolak, kembali mati. Saat aktif, tombol Tiup dalam game disembunyikan. Saat mati, game tetap melihat mikrofon GamePad, tetapi hanya mendengar tombol Tiup (hembusan udara simulasi) dan iOS tidak pernah meminta izin. Volume mikrofon (50 normal, 100 dua kali lebih keras) berlaku saat game berikutnya membuka mikrofon.";
"TV and GamePad audio have their own volume and channel layout. GamePad audio plays through this device's speaker or headphones. Use the microphone to give games your real voice and sounds through the GamePad mic; otherwise the in-game Blow button covers games that ask you to blow." = "Audio TV dan GamePad punya volume dan tata letak kanal sendiri. Audio GamePad diputar lewat speaker atau headphone perangkat ini. Gunakan mikrofon untuk memberi game suara asli Anda lewat mikrofon GamePad; jika tidak, tombol Tiup dalam game mencakup game yang meminta Anda meniup.";
