"That file is too big to be an amiibo dump (they are about 540 bytes)." = "File itu terlalu besar untuk dump amiibo (ukurannya sekitar 540 byte).";
"That file isn't readable text - keys.txt is a plain text file with one key per line." = "File itu bukan teks yang dapat dibaca - keys.txt adalah file teks biasa dengan satu kunci per baris.";
"That file was made by a newer MuffinEMU (move file version %d). Update the app, then try again." = "File itu dibuat oleh MuffinEMU yang lebih baru (versi file pindah %d). Perbarui app, lalu coba lagi.";
"That folder doesn't look like a Wii U save. Pick the folder named after the game's title ID, or the 'user' folder inside it." = "Folder itu tidak tampak seperti simpanan Wii U. Pilih folder yang dinamai sesuai ID judul game, atau folder 'user' di dalamnya.";
"That image couldn't be saved in a supported format." = "Gambar itu tidak dapat disimpan dalam format yang didukung.";
"That isn't a MuffinEMU move file." = "Itu bukan file pindah MuffinEMU.";
"That isn't a MuffinEMU settings file." = "Itu bukan file pengaturan MuffinEMU.";
"That isn't a usable network_services.xml. It needs a <content> element with a <urls> list of web addresses." = "Itu bukan network_services.xml yang dapat dipakai. Memerlukan elemen <content> dengan daftar <urls> berisi alamat web.";
"That link isn't valid." = "Tautan itu tidak valid.";
"That one didn't cover enough of the ring. Try again." = "Yang itu tidak cukup menutupi cincin. Coba lagi.";
"That title folder isn't a Wii U Menu (title id %@). The Menu is 0005001010040000, 0005001010040100 or 0005001010040200." = "Folder judul itu bukan Menu Wii U (ID judul %@). Menu adalah 0005001010040000, 0005001010040100, atau 0005001010040200.";
"The %@ link isn't valid. Check it in Settings, under JIT enabler." = "Tautan %@ tidak valid. Periksa di Pengaturan, di JIT enabler.";
"The .wua doesn't contain a matching update or DLC for this game." = ".wua tidak berisi pembaruan atau DLC yang cocok untuk game ini.";
"The .wua file couldn't be read. It may be corrupted." = "File .wua tidak dapat dibaca. Mungkin rusak.";
"The 3D box template behind MuffinEMU's no-cover images." = "Templat kotak 3D di balik gambar tanpa sampul MuffinEMU.";
"The Accuracy profile runs this game on one core whatever this says." = "Profil Akurasi menjalankan game ini pada satu inti apa pun isi ini.";
"The Battery saver profile runs this game on one core whatever this says." = "Profil Penghemat baterai menjalankan game ini pada satu inti apa pun isi ini.";
"The CPU line shows what this launch got: the recompiler (JIT), which is the fast way, or the interpreter, which is much slower. The recompiler needs a JIT enabler (StikJIT, SideStore or LiveContainer); both are set under JIT.\n\nCPU cores (Advanced mode) picks how many cores run a game. Auto decides for each game and device. The Accuracy and Battery saver performance profiles run on one core whatever this says.\n\nMemory shows how much the recompiler reserved. If it couldn't reserve any, the interpreter runs instead.\n\nCPU cores applies the next time you start a game." = "Baris CPU menunjukkan apa yang didapat peluncuran ini: recompiler (JIT), yang merupakan cara cepat, atau interpreter, yang jauh lebih lambat. Recompiler memerlukan JIT enabler (StikJIT, SideStore, atau LiveContainer); keduanya diatur di JIT.\n\nInti CPU (mode Lanjutan) memilih berapa banyak inti yang menjalankan game. Otomatis memutuskan untuk setiap game dan perangkat. Profil performa Akurasi dan Penghemat baterai berjalan pada satu inti apa pun isi ini.\n\nMemori menunjukkan berapa banyak yang dicadangkan recompiler. Jika tidak dapat mencadangkan apa pun, interpreter yang berjalan.\n\nInti CPU berlaku saat Anda memulai game berikutnya.";
"The FPS and usage readout over the game: what it lists, and where." = "Indikator FPS dan penggunaan di atas game: apa yang dicantumkan, dan di mana.";
"The GamePad at its real size and proportions, clean and sleek. Native keeps the picture clear; Fit wraps the pad around it." = "GamePad pada ukuran dan proporsi aslinya, bersih dan ramping. Native menjaga gambar tetap jelas; Pas membungkus pad di sekelilingnya.";
"The GamePad has no button bindings, so presses go nowhere while sticks still work. Settings > On-screen Controls > Reset controller bindings." = "GamePad tidak punya pengikatan tombol, jadi tekanan tidak ke mana-mana sementara stik masih bekerja. Pengaturan > Kontrol Layar > Reset pengikatan kontroler.";
"The GamePad layout, but each group of buttons slowly moves to where your thumbs actually press." = "Tata letak GamePad, tetapi setiap grup tombol perlahan bergerak ke tempat ibu jari Anda benar-benar menekan.";
"The GamePad's own layout with forgiving, gap-free touch zones, slide between buttons and two-button presses." = "Tata letak GamePad sendiri dengan zona sentuh toleran tanpa celah, geser antar tombol, dan tekanan dua tombol.";
"The GameTDB database couldn't be read." = "Database GameTDB tidak dapat dibaca.";
"The GameTDB download didn't contain wiiutdb.xml." = "Unduhan GameTDB tidak berisi wiiutdb.xml.";
"The Network Service can't be changed while a game is running. Close the game first." = "Layanan Jaringan tidak dapat diubah saat game berjalan. Tutup game terlebih dahulu.";
"The Speed performance profile is on (Performance, at the top of this page), so the picture is drawn at Balanced at most, with linear scaling." = "Profil performa Kecepatan aktif (Performa, di bagian atas halaman ini), jadi gambar digambar paling tinggi pada Seimbang, dengan penskalaan linear.";
"The Speed profile is on for this game, so the picture is drawn at Balanced at most, with linear scaling." = "Profil Kecepatan aktif untuk game ini, jadi gambar digambar paling tinggi pada Seimbang, dengan penskalaan linear.";
"The Wii U Menu and its system files." = "Menu Wii U dan file sistemnya.";
"The Wii U Menu may not start" = "Menu Wii U mungkin tidak dapat dimulai";
"The Wii U Menu was removed. Your saves and games weren't touched." = "Menu Wii U dihapus. Simpanan dan game Anda tidak disentuh.";
"The Wii U has two screens: the TV and the GamePad.\n\nScreen Layout: Single Screen shows one at a time with a swap button; Adaptive shows both, stacked in portrait and side by side in landscape; Both Screens (GamePad Top Right) keeps the TV full size with a small GamePad inset.\n\nWith Single Screen, Pause the TV screen and Pause the GamePad screen stop drawing whichever screen is out of sight, to save heat and battery. The game keeps running. They are under Performance too.\n\nStretch picture to fill the screen fills the screen's own shape instead of keeping the Wii U's 1280x720 proportions, which otherwise letterboxes with bars on two sides. Off keeps the picture undistorted; on trades that for using every pixel. Takes effect on the very next frame.\n\nFlip screen upside down (Advanced mode) turns both Wii U screens vertically before they reach the screen. Off for everyone except a panel or capture rig that presents the image inverted.\n\nAllow portrait during games (iPhone): hold the phone upright and the picture goes along the top with the controls below it. Menus stay in landscape. Turn it off if you'd rather a game never turns when the phone tilts; the iOS rotation lock works too." = "Wii U memiliki dua layar: TV dan GamePad.\n\nTata Letak Layar: Layar Tunggal menampilkan satu per satu dengan tombol tukar; Adaptif menampilkan keduanya, bertumpuk di potret dan berdampingan di lanskap; Kedua Layar (GamePad di Kanan Atas) menjaga TV berukuran penuh dengan sisipan GamePad kecil.\n\nDengan Layar Tunggal, Jeda layar TV dan Jeda layar GamePad berhenti menggambar layar mana pun yang tidak terlihat, untuk menghemat panas dan baterai. Game tetap berjalan. Keduanya juga ada di Performa.\n\nRegangkan gambar memenuhi layar mengisi bentuk layar itu sendiri, bukan mempertahankan proporsi 1280x720 Wii U, yang selain itu membuat bilah hitam di dua sisi. Mati menjaga gambar tidak terdistorsi; aktif menukarnya dengan memakai setiap piksel. Berlaku pada frame berikutnya.\n\nBalik layar terbalik (mode Lanjutan) memutar kedua layar Wii U secara vertikal sebelum sampai ke layar. Mati untuk semua orang kecuali panel atau rig perekam yang menampilkan gambar terbalik.\n\nIzinkan potret saat bermain (iPhone): pegang ponsel tegak dan gambar berada di atas dengan kontrol di bawahnya. Menu tetap lanskap. Matikan jika Anda tidak ingin game berputar saat ponsel dimiringkan; kunci rotasi iOS juga berfungsi.";
"The area you tap to bring the bar back. Large is easier to hit, but it can take touches meant for the GamePad screen at the top of the picture." = "Area yang Anda ketuk untuk memunculkan bilah kembali. Besar lebih mudah ditekan, tetapi dapat menangkap sentuhan yang ditujukan untuk layar GamePad di bagian atas gambar.";
"The art pack list couldn't be loaded. Check your connection and try again." = "Daftar paket seni tidak dapat dimuat. Periksa koneksi Anda dan coba lagi.";
"The bar fades away a few seconds after you last touch it. Tap the small handle at the top of the screen, or swipe down from it, to bring it back. It stays up while paused, in menus, and with VoiceOver on. On by default." = "Bilah memudar beberapa detik setelah sentuhan terakhir. Ketuk pegangan kecil di bagian atas layar, atau geser ke bawah darinya, untuk memunculkannya kembali. Bilah tetap tampil saat dijeda, di menu, dan dengan VoiceOver aktif. Aktif secara default.";
"The community packs are downloaded from the Cemu graphic packs project's latest release on GitHub. The download is verified (size and a checksum on every file) before it replaces anything, and it needs free space for the zip and the extracted copy. If it fails or is cancelled, the packs you already have stay as they were.\n\nMuffinEMU checks for a newer release when you open this screen, at most once a day, or when you tap Check for updates. Pack choices (which packs are on and their options) are kept across updates.\n\nThe download keeps going if you leave the app." = "Paket komunitas diunduh dari rilis terbaru proyek paket grafis Cemu di GitHub. Unduhan diverifikasi (ukuran dan checksum pada setiap file) sebelum mengganti apa pun, dan memerlukan ruang kosong untuk zip dan salinan yang diekstrak. Jika gagal atau dibatalkan, paket yang sudah Anda miliki tetap seperti semula.\n\nMuffinEMU memeriksa rilis lebih baru saat Anda membuka layar ini, paling banyak sekali sehari, atau saat Anda mengetuk Periksa pembaruan. Pilihan paket (paket mana yang aktif dan opsinya) dipertahankan di antara pembaruan.\n\nUnduhan terus berjalan jika Anda meninggalkan app.";
"The community packs are made by the Cemu graphic packs project and its contributors." = "Paket komunitas dibuat oleh proyek paket grafis Cemu dan para kontributornya.";
"The community packs don't include one for %@. You can still import your own below." = "Paket komunitas tidak menyertakan satu untuk %@. Anda tetap dapat mengimpor milik Anda sendiri di bawah.";
"The console will appear connected." = "Konsol akan tampak terhubung.";
"The console will appear offline." = "Konsol akan tampak offline.";
"The controls come back when it disconnects. The GamePad's screen stays, so you can still touch it." = "Kontrol kembali saat terputus. Layar GamePad tetap ada, jadi Anda masih dapat menyentuhnya.";
"The controls disappear while the home menu is open and come back when it closes." = "Kontrol menghilang saat menu home terbuka dan kembali saat ditutup.";
"The controls fade almost out after a few seconds without a touch, and come straight back under your thumb." = "Kontrol hampir memudar setelah beberapa detik tanpa sentuhan, dan langsung kembali di bawah ibu jari Anda.";
"The defaults suit most games, so change one thing at a time. Performance profile, at the top, is the quickest way to trade speed against accuracy or battery. A single game can have its own values: open it in the library, then Game settings." = "Nilai default cocok untuk kebanyakan game, jadi ubah satu hal pada satu waktu. Profil performa, di bagian atas, adalah cara tercepat menukar kecepatan dengan akurasi atau baterai. Satu game dapat memiliki nilainya sendiri: buka di pustaka, lalu Pengaturan game.";
"The device has cooled down. The game should run at full speed again." = "Perangkat sudah dingin. Game seharusnya berjalan dengan kecepatan penuh lagi.";
"The device has cooled down. The picture is back to normal." = "Perangkat sudah dingin. Gambar kembali normal.";
"The device is hot, so MuffinEMU made the picture softer to keep the game running. It goes back when the device cools." = "Perangkat panas, jadi MuffinEMU membuat gambar lebih lembut agar game tetap berjalan. Kembali saat perangkat dingin.";
"The device is hot, so iOS is slowing the game down. After you quit, try Cool down automatically (Settings, CPU) or a lower Resolution (Settings, Graphics)." = "Perangkat panas, jadi iOS memperlambat game. Setelah keluar, coba Dinginkan otomatis (Pengaturan, CPU) atau Resolusi lebih rendah (Pengaturan, Grafis).";
"The download failed (%@)." = "Unduhan gagal (%@).";
"The download finished but couldn't be saved: %@" = "Unduhan selesai tetapi tidak dapat disimpan: %@";
"The download of %@ didn't match its checksum, so it was thrown away. Try again." = "Unduhan %@ tidak cocok dengan checksum-nya, jadi dibuang. Coba lagi.";
"The download server answered with error %d." = "Server unduhan menjawab dengan kesalahan %d.";
"The downloadable packs are the Cemu graphic packs project's community collection (github.com/cemu-project/cemu_graphic_packs), made and maintained by its many contributors and released under the CC0 1.0 public domain dedication. MuffinEMU downloads them straight from that project's releases and doesn't change them.\n\nPacks that replace shaders are written for OpenGL and Vulkan. The Metal renderer can't use those shaders, so such packs are marked. Packs made only of settings, presets and patches work with Metal." = "Paket yang dapat diunduh adalah koleksi komunitas proyek paket grafis Cemu (github.com/cemu-project/cemu_graphic_packs), dibuat dan dikelola oleh banyak kontributornya dan dirilis di bawah dedikasi domain publik CC0 1.0. MuffinEMU mengunduhnya langsung dari rilis proyek itu dan tidak mengubahnya.\n\nPaket yang mengganti shader ditulis untuk OpenGL dan Vulkan. Renderer Metal tidak dapat memakai shader itu, jadi paket seperti itu diberi tanda. Paket yang hanya berisi pengaturan, preset, dan patch berfungsi dengan Metal.";
"The drive or folder this game is stored on was disconnected. Connect it again, go back and start the game again." = "Drive atau folder tempat game ini disimpan terputus. Hubungkan lagi, kembali, dan mulai game lagi.";
"The emulated console's clock speed." = "Kecepatan jam konsol yang diemulasi.";
"The engine didn't report a reason." = "Engine tidak melaporkan alasan.";
"The experimental new pad is active. If controls don't respond, turn off Use the new pad system in Settings > On-screen Controls > New pad system (preview)." = "Pad baru eksperimental aktif. Jika kontrol tidak merespons, matikan Gunakan sistem pad baru di Pengaturan > Kontrol Layar > Sistem pad baru (pratinjau).";
"The external display is off by default; turn it on before connecting a display. Then choose which Wii U screen it shows, and what this device shows next to it: the other screen, the same screen, or only the controls. It is experimental and hasn't been tested on much hardware.\n\nThe HOME menu has the same settings during a game." = "Layar eksternal mati secara default; aktifkan sebelum menghubungkan layar. Lalu pilih layar Wii U mana yang ditampilkannya, dan apa yang ditampilkan perangkat ini di sampingnya: layar lainnya, layar yang sama, atau hanya kontrol. Ini eksperimental dan belum diuji pada banyak perangkat keras.\n\nMenu HOME memiliki pengaturan yang sama selama game.";
"The external display shows the %@ and this device shows the %@." = "Layar eksternal menampilkan %@ dan perangkat ini menampilkan %@.";
"The external display shows the %@. This device shows only the on-screen controls on black." = "Layar eksternal menampilkan %@. Perangkat ini hanya menampilkan kontrol di layar di atas hitam.";
"The fast way to run games. Needs a JIT enabler; without one the slow interpreter runs instead." = "Cara cepat menjalankan game. Memerlukan JIT enabler; tanpanya interpreter lambat yang berjalan.";
"The file isn't a valid zip archive." = "File itu bukan arsip zip yang valid.";
"The file you picked wasn't changed." = "File yang Anda pilih tidak diubah.";
"The game is still running but the screen isn't taking frames. This goes away by itself if it recovers. If it doesn't, tap Quit Game and reopen MuffinEMU." = "Game masih berjalan tetapi layar tidak menerima frame. Ini hilang sendiri jika pulih. Jika tidak, ketuk Keluar dari Game dan buka kembali MuffinEMU.";
"The game itself and your saves are not touched." = "Game itu sendiri dan simpanan Anda tidak disentuh.";
"The game stopped. Go back and try it again. If it keeps happening, close and reopen MuffinEMU." = "Game berhenti. Kembali dan coba lagi. Jika terus terjadi, tutup dan buka kembali MuffinEMU.";
"The game stutters while it relearns its shaders." = "Game tersendat saat mempelajari shader-nya lagi.";
"The game waits while you move or adjust the on-screen controls, and carries on when you tap Done." = "Game menunggu saat Anda memindahkan atau menyesuaikan kontrol di layar, dan lanjut saat Anda mengetuk Selesai.";
"The images are removed from this device. You can download %@ again later." = "Gambar dihapus dari perangkat ini. Anda dapat mengunduh %@ lagi nanti.";
"The intro plays during the boot. If you turn on the launch log it takes the screen instead, so you can see timestamped boot steps when a game starts but stays black." = "Intro diputar saat booting. Jika Anda mengaktifkan log peluncuran, log mengambil alih layar, sehingga Anda dapat melihat langkah boot berstempel waktu saat game dimulai tetapi tetap hitam.";
"The intro plays while a game starts." = "Intro diputar saat game dimulai.";
"The keys.txt encrypted games need." = "keys.txt yang dibutuhkan game terenkripsi.";
"The language MuffinEMU's menus are in." = "Bahasa menu MuffinEMU.";
"The latest release doesn't have a download MuffinEMU can use." = "Rilis terbaru tidak memiliki unduhan yang dapat dipakai MuffinEMU.";
"The latest release is a different size than graphic packs should be." = "Rilis terbaru berukuran berbeda dari yang seharusnya untuk paket grafis.";
"The launch intro, launch log and controls diagnostic." = "Intro peluncuran, log peluncuran, dan diagnostik kontrol.";
"The launch log shows boot progress and replaces the intro while it's on." = "Log peluncuran menampilkan progres boot dan menggantikan intro selama aktif.";
"The layout from a 12.9-inch iPad Pro, fitted to your screen." = "Tata letak dari iPad Pro 12,9 inci, disesuaikan dengan layar Anda.";
"The least the game is sent once you are past the inner deadzone. For games that have a deadzone of their own and ignore small pushes." = "Minimum yang dikirim ke game setelah Anda melewati deadzone dalam. Untuk game yang punya deadzone sendiri dan mengabaikan dorongan kecil.";
"The link needs {bundleId} in it, and has to be a valid URL." = "Tautan harus memuat {bundleId}, dan harus berupa URL yang valid.";
"The list holds the control style, Add analog sticks and the resets. Size and feel (button size, opacity, haptics and, on iPad, shoulder height), Stick tuning and During play (the top bar and when the controls hide) are pages of their own.\n\nAdd analog sticks puts both sticks on screen alongside the d-pad and face buttons. Push further for more speed.\n\nGate is the shape the stick can reach. Octagon matches the real GamePad; Round reaches full travel in every direction.\n\nCalibrate sticks has you rest your thumb, push to every edge and let go, then sets where full push is and ignores the wobble of your resting thumb. It applies to every control style.\n\nDeadzone is how far you can move before the game notices. Turn it up only if a resting thumb makes the game drift.\n\nFine control makes small movements gentler: at linear, halfway is half speed; higher values make halfway slower.\n\nIn Advanced mode, Stick fine-tuning sets each stick on its own: inner deadzone, outer deadzone (where full push is reached), anti-deadzone (the least the game is sent once past the deadzone, for games with their own), fine control, horizontal and vertical sensitivity, and invert. Its test circle shows what the game is sent. It is also in the move-controls panel in a game. The Deadzone and Fine control sliders set both sticks.\n\nStick spacing moves both sticks closer together or further apart, for smaller or bigger hands. On a narrow screen it stops before the sticks would touch.\n\nOn iPad, L, R, ZL and ZR height moves the four shoulder buttons up or down together, stopping before they would leave the screen or touch a stick or button.\n\nButton size and opacity adjust the size MuffinEMU picks for your screen.\n\nHide the top bar while playing fades the Back and pause bar out a few seconds after you last touch it, so it stops covering the picture. A small handle stays at the top centre of the screen: tap it, or swipe down from it, to bring the bar back. The bar stays up while the game is paused, a menu is open, or VoiceOver is on.\n\nIn Advanced mode, Top bar hides after sets the wait (2, 4 or 8 seconds) and Reveal handle sets the size of the area you tap to bring the bar back. Normal is the default; Large is easier to hit but can take touches meant for the GamePad screen at the top of the picture.\n\nHide on-screen controls when a controller is connected takes the controls off the screen while a controller is paired, and puts them back when it disconnects. It is off by default. The GamePad's screen stays visible and touchable either way.\n\nThese settings apply to every game. Two things are kept per game instead: Adaptive remembers where your thumbs land, and Melo-Controller remembers where you moved its buttons.\n\nTo move a cluster, start a game and tap the move button in the top bar. There you can also switch control style without leaving the game." = "Daftar memuat gaya kontrol, Tambah stik analog, dan reset. Ukuran dan nuansa (ukuran tombol, opasitas, haptik, dan di iPad, tinggi bahu), Penyetelan stik, dan Saat bermain (bilah atas dan kapan kontrol disembunyikan) adalah halaman tersendiri.\n\nTambah stik analog menaruh kedua stik di layar bersama d-pad dan tombol wajah. Dorong lebih jauh untuk kecepatan lebih.\n\nGerbang adalah bentuk yang dapat dijangkau stik. Oktagonal sesuai GamePad asli; Bulat mencapai jarak penuh ke segala arah.\n\nKalibrasi stik meminta Anda mengistirahatkan ibu jari, mendorong ke setiap tepi, lalu melepas, kemudian menentukan di mana dorongan penuh berada dan mengabaikan goyangan ibu jari yang diam. Berlaku untuk semua gaya kontrol.\n\nDeadzone adalah seberapa jauh Anda bisa bergerak sebelum game menyadarinya. Naikkan hanya jika ibu jari yang diam membuat game bergeser.\n\nKontrol halus membuat gerakan kecil lebih lembut: pada linear, setengah berarti setengah kecepatan; nilai lebih tinggi membuat setengah lebih lambat.\n\nDi mode Lanjutan, Penyesuaian halus stik mengatur tiap stik sendiri: deadzone dalam, deadzone luar (tempat dorongan penuh tercapai), anti-deadzone (minimum yang dikirim ke game setelah melewati deadzone, untuk game dengan deadzone sendiri), kontrol halus, sensitivitas horizontal dan vertikal, dan pembalikan. Lingkaran ujinya menunjukkan apa yang dikirim ke game. Ini juga ada di panel pindahkan kontrol dalam game. Slider Deadzone dan Kontrol halus mengatur kedua stik.\n\nJarak stik memindahkan kedua stik lebih dekat atau lebih jauh, untuk tangan lebih kecil atau lebih besar. Pada layar sempit, berhenti sebelum stik bersentuhan.\n\nDi iPad, tinggi L, R, ZL, dan ZR menggerakkan keempat tombol bahu naik atau turun bersama, berhenti sebelum keluar layar atau menyentuh stik atau tombol.\n\nUkuran tombol dan opasitas menyesuaikan ukuran yang dipilih MuffinEMU untuk layar Anda.\n\nSembunyikan bilah atas saat bermain memudarkan bilah Kembali dan jeda beberapa detik setelah sentuhan terakhir, agar tidak menutupi gambar. Pegangan kecil tetap di tengah atas layar: ketuk, atau geser ke bawah darinya, untuk memunculkan bilah kembali. Bilah tetap tampil saat game dijeda, menu terbuka, atau VoiceOver aktif.\n\nDi mode Lanjutan, Bilah atas disembunyikan setelah mengatur waktu tunggu (2, 4, atau 8 detik) dan Tampilkan pegangan mengatur ukuran area yang Anda ketuk untuk memunculkan bilah kembali. Normal adalah default; Besar lebih mudah ditekan tetapi dapat menangkap sentuhan yang ditujukan untuk layar GamePad di bagian atas gambar.\n\nSembunyikan kontrol di layar saat kontroler terhubung menghilangkan kontrol dari layar selama kontroler dipasangkan, dan mengembalikannya saat terputus. Mati secara default. Layar GamePad tetap terlihat dan dapat disentuh dalam kedua kasus.\n\nPengaturan ini berlaku untuk semua game. Dua hal disimpan per game: Adaptif mengingat di mana ibu jari Anda mendarat, dan Melo-Controller mengingat ke mana Anda memindahkan tombolnya.\n\nUntuk memindahkan kelompok tombol, mulai game dan ketuk tombol pindah di bilah atas. Di sana Anda juga dapat mengganti gaya kontrol tanpa meninggalkan game.";
"The match is for this install only. Another copy of the same game can match differently." = "Kecocokan hanya untuk instalasi ini. Salinan lain dari game yang sama bisa cocok berbeda.";
"The move file is damaged (%@). Nothing in it was trusted past that point." = "File pindah rusak (%@). Tidak ada di dalamnya yang dipercaya setelah titik itu.";
"The next launch of each game is slow once." = "Peluncuran berikutnya setiap game lambat satu kali.";
"The next start of this game is slow once." = "Permulaan berikutnya game ini lambat satu kali.";
"The normal balance of speed and picture quality." = "Keseimbangan normal antara kecepatan dan kualitas gambar.";
"The old account %@ was saved as %@." = "Akun lama %@ disimpan sebagai %@.";
"The on-screen pad can add analog sticks and comfort controls, and any MFi, Xbox, or PlayStation controller works right alongside it." = "Pad di layar dapat menambahkan stik analog dan kontrol nyaman, dan kontroler MFi, Xbox, atau PlayStation mana pun berfungsi bersamanya.";
"The on-screen pad, motion aiming and figure portals." = "Pad di layar, bidikan gerak, dan portal figur.";
"The original is never changed." = "File asli tidak pernah diubah.";
"The other screen" = "Layar lainnya";
"The overlay is the engine's own readout. Position picks a corner of the TV screen; Off hides it, and the other rows stay dimmed until a corner is chosen.\n\nFPS is the frame rate the game is producing. CPU, per-core CPU, RAM and VRAM usage measure MuffinEMU itself, not the whole device. Draw calls counts draw commands in the current frame. Debug info adds a few lines of renderer state.\n\nThe panel only appears while at least one of FPS, draw calls, CPU, per-core CPU or RAM is on. VRAM usage and debug info are extra lines inside it, so on their own they show nothing.\n\nText size and colour change the readout's look. Changes show up straight away." = "Overlay adalah indikator engine sendiri. Posisi memilih sudut layar TV; Mati menyembunyikannya, dan baris lain tetap redup sampai sudut dipilih.\n\nFPS adalah frame rate yang dihasilkan game. Penggunaan CPU, CPU per inti, RAM, dan VRAM mengukur MuffinEMU sendiri, bukan seluruh perangkat. Draw call menghitung perintah gambar di frame saat ini. Info debug menambahkan beberapa baris status renderer.\n\nPanel hanya muncul selama setidaknya satu dari FPS, draw call, CPU, CPU per inti, atau RAM aktif. Penggunaan VRAM dan info debug adalah baris tambahan di dalamnya, jadi sendirian tidak menampilkan apa pun.\n\nUkuran teks dan warna mengubah tampilan indikator. Perubahan langsung terlihat.";
"The pack unpacked, but no images were found in it." = "Paket berhasil diekstrak, tetapi tidak ada gambar di dalamnya.";
"The pack's download address is invalid." = "Alamat unduhan paket tidak valid.";
"The performance profile, pausing a hidden screen, and cooling down." = "Profil performa, menjeda layar tersembunyi, dan pendinginan.";
"The persistent ID must be %@ or higher." = "ID persisten harus %@ atau lebih tinggi.";
"The persistent ID must be hexadecimal (0-9, A-F)." = "ID persisten harus heksadesimal (0-9, A-F).";
"The picture froze" = "Gambar membeku";
"The picture has stopped while the game keeps running. This goes away by itself if the picture comes back." = "Gambar berhenti sementara game terus berjalan. Ini hilang sendiri jika gambar kembali.";
"The polished look on every control style: hairline outlines, soft shadows, a lit rim and buttons that sink when pressed. Off keeps the flat look." = "Tampilan mengilap di setiap gaya kontrol: garis tepi tipis, bayangan lembut, tepi bercahaya, dan tombol yang tenggelam saat ditekan. Mati mempertahankan tampilan datar.";
"The pro app icons are yours." = "Ikon app pro milik Anda.";
"The pro app icons." = "Ikon app pro.";
"The profile applies the next time you start a game. Cool down automatically only acts when the device overheats; Battery saver is the always-on version." = "Profil berlaku saat Anda memulai game berikutnya. Dinginkan otomatis hanya bertindak saat perangkat terlalu panas; Penghemat baterai adalah versi yang selalu aktif.";
"The recompiler, whether JIT is on, and the enabler that turns it on." = "Recompiler, apakah JIT aktif, dan enabler yang mengaktifkannya.";
"The recording stopped because storage is almost full. What was recorded is saved in the Recordings folder." = "Perekaman berhenti karena penyimpanan hampir penuh. Yang sudah direkam disimpan di folder Recordings.";
"The recording stopped because the video couldn't be written." = "Perekaman berhenti karena video tidak dapat ditulis.";
"The same screen as the TV" = "Layar yang sama dengan TV";
"The same title was added twice." = "Judul yang sama ditambahkan dua kali.";
"The same version is already installed. Reinstalling replaces it. Save data is not touched." = "Versi yang sama sudah terpasang. Pemasangan ulang menggantinya. Data simpanan tidak disentuh.";
"The save the game itself writes. Not a save state. Export is available once the game has saved." = "Simpanan yang ditulis game itu sendiri. Bukan status simpan. Ekspor tersedia setelah game menyimpan.";
"The saved copy is removed. If it's the active server, the active network_services.xml is removed too." = "Salinan tersimpan dihapus. Jika itu server aktif, network_services.xml aktif juga dihapus.";
"The screen stopped updating" = "Layar berhenti diperbarui";
"The skin applies to every game." = "Skin berlaku untuk setiap game.";
"The slowest setting. If a game still won't move, the clock isn't the problem." = "Pengaturan paling lambat. Jika game masih tidak bergerak, jam bukan masalahnya.";
"The stick's centre is wherever your thumb lands in its zone, so the first touch is never a push." = "Pusat stik adalah di mana pun ibu jari Anda mendarat di zonanya, jadi sentuhan pertama tidak pernah berupa dorongan.";
"The title list comes from GameTDB's database. Scrape once to download it." = "Daftar judul berasal dari database GameTDB. Ambil sekali untuk mengunduhnya.";
"The top bar, and when the controls hide or pause the game." = "Bilah atas, dan kapan kontrol disembunyikan atau menjeda game.";
"The touch pad: size, opacity, sticks and when it hides." = "Pad sentuh: ukuran, opasitas, stik, dan kapan disembunyikan.";
"The update or DLC belongs to a different game." = "Pembaruan atau DLC milik game lain.";
"The v2.0 look: flat cards, plain headers, system-font rows." = "Tampilan v2.0: kartu datar, header polos, baris font sistem.";
"The zip contains a path outside its own folder (%@)." = "Zip berisi jalur di luar foldernya sendiri (%@).";
"The zip couldn't be read." = "Zip tidak dapat dibaca.";
