"Turning a device on or off takes effect when a game next looks for it, which is usually when the game starts. If a figure doesn't appear in a game that's already running, quit it and start it again." = "Menyalakan atau mematikan perangkat berlaku saat game berikutnya mencarinya, biasanya saat game dimulai. Jika figur tidak muncul di game yang sudah berjalan, keluar dan mulai lagi.";
"Two cores (Experimental)" = "Dua inti (Eksperimental)";
"Two cores. Runs the console's three cores on two host threads: faster than one core, with less heat and fewer performance cores than three." = "Dua inti. Menjalankan tiga inti konsol pada dua thread host: lebih cepat dari satu inti, dengan panas lebih sedikit dan inti performa lebih sedikit daripada tiga.";
"Type the game's name. Entries for this install's region are listed first." = "Ketik nama game. Entri untuk wilayah instalasi ini tercantum lebih dulu.";
