"Unlocks the pro app icons. Everything else in MuffinEMU is free." = "Membuka kunci ikon app pro. Semua yang lain di MuffinEMU gratis.";
"Unpacking" = "Mengekstrak";
"Until you choose a value, MuffinEMU picks one itself: if a game hasn't started drawing after 12 seconds, it slows its clock a step (down to 1/64). Choosing a value here turns that off.\n\nWithout the recompiler the emulated CPU is much slower than the console's, so games can fall behind their own timers and never draw a frame. Slowing the game's clock gives them room. Emulation accuracy isn't affected." = "Sampai Anda memilih nilai, MuffinEMU memilih sendiri: jika game belum mulai menggambar setelah 12 detik, jamnya diperlambat satu langkah (hingga 1/64). Memilih nilai di sini mematikannya.\n\nTanpa recompiler, CPU emulasi jauh lebih lambat daripada konsol, jadi game bisa tertinggal dari timer-nya sendiri dan tidak pernah menggambar frame. Memperlambat jam game memberi mereka ruang. Akurasi emulasi tidak terpengaruh.";
"Up to %d local" = "Hingga %d lokal";
"Update" = "Pembaruan";
