"Wait for it" = "Tunggu";
"Waits until iOS is slowing the device hard. The game keeps its quality longer, and may stutter or run hot first." = "Menunggu sampai iOS memperlambat perangkat dengan keras. Game mempertahankan kualitasnya lebih lama, dan mungkin tersendat atau panas lebih dulu.";
"Warm" = "Hangat";
"Welcome to MuffinEMU" = "Selamat Datang di MuffinEMU";
"What every game has saved so it starts faster. To clear one game, open its page in the library. Clearing needs the game closed." = "Yang disimpan setiap game agar dimulai lebih cepat. Untuk menghapus satu game, buka halamannya di pustaka. Penghapusan memerlukan game tertutup.";
"What the CPU runs, CPU cores and memory." = "Apa yang dijalankan CPU, inti CPU, dan memori.";
"What this device shows (\"here\") while the external display is connected." = "Apa yang ditampilkan perangkat ini (\"di sini\") saat layar eksternal terhubung.";
"What this game has saved so it starts faster. Clearing needs the game closed." = "Yang disimpan game ini agar dimulai lebih cepat. Penghapusan memerlukan game tertutup.";
"When JIT isn't active, MuffinEMU asks once each time it opens, and offers to open the enabler. It never asks during a game. A custom link is filled in with MuffinEMU's bundle ID wherever it says {bundleId}." = "Saat JIT tidak aktif, MuffinEMU bertanya sekali setiap kali dibuka, dan menawarkan membuka enabler. Tidak pernah bertanya selama game. Tautan kustom diisi dengan bundle ID MuffinEMU di mana pun tertulis {bundleId}.";
